<title>USA: Amcast Industrial Corp Q2 includes charge.</title>
<headline>Amcast Industrial Corp Q2 includes charge.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>($ in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended    Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				Mar 2     Mar 3	Mar 2	Mar 3</p>
<p>				1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net sales		 91,334    81,796    182,123    168,261</p>
